Description

Built in 2016 by Crest Nicholson, this impressive five-bedroom executive property on Clay Farm Drive combines contemporary design, high-quality finishes, and exceptional energy efficiency. Arranged over four versatile floors, the home offers flexible accommodation ideally suited to modern living, home working, multi-generational households, and entertaining, complemented by a private courtyard garden with bespoke pergola and a first-floor terrace.
The ground floor centres around a stunning open-plan kitchen and dining space, designed by German manufacturer Alno and fitted with integrated Smeg appliances, soft-close cabinetry, LED under-unit lighting and a Hansgrohe mixer tap. Glass doors open onto the landscaped courtyard garden, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living. A utility room and cloakroom complete the ground floor.
On the first floor, the spacious drawing room is flooded with natural light through triple-glazed Rational ‘Aura Plus’ windows with solar film. This level also features a generous en-suite bedroom with Roca Gap sanitaryware and Amtico flooring, opening directly onto a private terrace. Ideal as a guest suite, home office or gym, this space offers excellent flexibility.
The second floor comprises a double bedroom and a king-size bedroom with en-suite shower room, both benefiting from bespoke Sharps fitted wardrobes, alongside a well-appointed family bathroom. The top floor offers two further light-filled bedrooms with Juliet balconies, elevated views across Cambridge and a shared Jack and Jill bathroom. Four bedrooms are enhanced by discreet climate-controlled air conditioning for year-round comfort.
Outside, the terrace has been designed as a private, low-maintenance retreat, ideal for relaxing and entertaining. A rare full-sized double garage provides secure parking, excellent storage and potential for EV charging.
Designed with sustainability in mind, the property incorporates a mechanical ventilation heat recovery system, a living sedum roof and a high-efficiency low NOX boiler with zoned thermostats. Engineered oak flooring with zone-controlled underfloor heating runs throughout the principal living spaces, ensuring comfort and efficiency.
