This elegant one bed flat is set within a grand Grade II listed converted house in the perfect Canonbury location on Alwyne Road.

The flat is accessed by the side gate and has it''s own front door which leads you into the modern galley kitchen.

The reception/dining room is very spacious and set to the front so has great light with the South facing aspect. This room has a wonderful floor and many period features including a working fireplace and stone surround plus shutters on the deep sash windows.

The bathroom has been recently refurbished with a free standing bath and separate shower.

The double bedroom is to the rear and has fitted wardrobes.

The flat has it''s own private outside space to the side plus the garden to the front and has use of the charming Alywne''s private garden.

Alwyne Road is now within the low traffic neighbourhood which makes this location so quiet and tranquil.

It is rare to find a one bed garden flat within this area so viewing is essential. The flat is offered chain free.

Location

Alwyne Road is a wonderful quiet location in the heart of Canonbury just off the New River Walk.

All the shops, restaurants and bars of Upper Street are a short walk away and transport links are excellent with Highbury & Islington station close by with the Victoria line and Overground giving access to the whole of London. There are numerous buses on Upper Street and Essex Road.

