A spacious ground-floor apartment with its own wrap around private garden & terrace, this two-bedroom home is all about indoor-outdoor living.

The open-plan kitchen, dining and living space stretches over 9 metres, with full-height doors opening directly onto a paved terrace and lawn- perfect for morning coffee or warm summer evenings.
Both bedrooms are generously sized, and the principal features an en suite for added comfort. With acoustic oak panelling, engineered herringbone flooring, and serene garden views, this home feels tucked away from the city - while still being right in the middle of it. Complete with a utility room and a large entrance into the home.
Contemporary Craftsmanship
Step inside Roman Way and you’ll notice the difference straight away. From the warmth of real oak veneer panelling to the texture of herringbone wood flooring, each home is designed with care and character.
Every finish has been thoughtfully selected; chrome accents in the bathrooms, bespoke stone shelving, and sleek handleless kitchens with integrated AEG appliances, creating a space that feels refined yet comfortable.
Whether it’s the quiet luxury of the penthouse or the calm retreat of the garden apartment, these homes strike the perfect balance between style and ease.A collection of just eight contemporary apartments, perfectly balancing clean modern design with everyday comfort, all just moments from Caledonian Road
Kitchen
At Roman Way, the kitchens are as functional as they are stylish. Each one is fitted with sleek handleless cabinetry and finished with durable quartz worktops and matching splashbacks for a clean, contemporary look.
Integrated AEG appliances—including an induction hob, oven, fridge/freezer, dishwasher and washer/dryer—make day-to-day cooking and entertaining effortless. It’s a space designed for modern living.
Bathrooms
Designed as calm, elegant retreats, the bathrooms at Roman Way combine refined materials with clever design. Porcelain Viente Urbancrete tiles wrap the space, complemented by chrome fixtures and fittings for a crisp, modern finish.
Stone shelves and large bespoke mirrors add practical touches with a premium feel, while integrated vanity units and walk-in showers complete the sleek, spa-inspired look.
From Roman Way, it’s a 5-minute stroll to Caledonian Road Station and just 3 minutes to King’s Cross. You’re always just a few stops from the action.

Wellness, Socials & Sunday Coffee
