A beautifully presented four-bedroom detached family home occupying a generous plot on the highly sought-after Church Road in Reading. Ideally positioned within easy reach of outstanding local schools, this spacious property offers versatile accommodation, ample off-road parking, and a stunning mature rear garden, making it an ideal home for growing families.

