LOCATION
Ideally located in the heart of Highgate village, which is one of London''s prestigious remaining villages, this property enjoys all the advantages of one of North London''s most desirable and characterful neighbourhoods. The property is on Highgate High Street, renowned for its village charm and vibrant community feel. The high street is home to an array of artisan bakeries, restaurants, traditional pubs, and boutique shops, as well as convenient everyday amenities.
