Green open spaces are a defining feature of the location. The vast expanse of Hampstead Heath is nearby, offering acres of woodland, walking trails, and some of London''s most breathtaking views. Closer still and directly opposite the proprerty is the beautifully maintained Waterlow Park, a local favourite known for its landscaped gardens, tranquil ponds, and panoramic views.
