MESSAGE FROM THE OWNERS
We''ve been incredibly happy living here and are so sad to leave! It''s got everything. The building, so full of character and charm, is in the heart of Highgate Village which has such a warm community with independent cafes, excellent pubs and wonderful shops. The endlessly beautiful Waterlow Park is directly opposite which is perfect for dogs. As well as that, Hampstead Heath is a short walk away with great transport links (Highgate or Archway tube) into the West End and the City are a short walk away. Most of all we will miss living here because of the great sense of community which is home to the nicest people and gives you a real village vibe that you would not expect to have bang in the middle of North London. We will miss living here for all of these reasons!

