The property also benefits from a location that combines the convenience of Tilehurst and Reading with easy access to surrounding countryside. There are a good range of local schools, shops and everyday amenities nearby, while Tilehurst offers regular transport links into Reading and connections beyond. The number 17 bus route is approximately 100 metres from the property and runs throughout the night, providing a direct link to Reading Station. This makes a convenient door-to-door journey to London Paddington possible in approximately 35 minutes, offering an excellent option for commuters. Tilehurst railway station also provides services towards Reading, London Paddington and Oxford, while the nearby M4 provides convenient road connections towards London, the wider Thames Valley and the West Country.
Overall, this is a substantial and highly adaptable detached family home offering excellent existing accommodation, exceptional parking, a generous private garden, an immaculate detached studio and a loft that is already equipped with first-fix plumbing, electrics and heating, ready for completion by the new owners. With its combination of space, versatility, privacy, transport links and location, this is a property that needs to be viewed to fully appreciate everything it has to offer.', 'Arins Property Services, Tilehurst', '2026-07-09T17:09:34Z', '2026-10-23T23:14:08Z', '[]', 'train');

Boasting approximately 893 sq ft of well-appointed accommodation, the property combines stylish interiors, impressive natural light and superb outdoor space with the convenience of Oxford city centre just moments away.

The spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area forms the centrepiece of the home, featuring floor-to-ceiling glazing that floods the space with natural light and opens directly onto a private terrace with elevated rooftop views across Oxford. The modern kitchen is seamlessly integrated into the living space, creating an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining.

The apartment offers two generous double bedrooms, each benefiting from direct access to a private rear balcony, providing additional outdoor space and a peaceful retreat from city life. Complemented by contemporary bathroom facilities and a welcoming entrance hall, the property has been designed to maximise comfort, practicality and style.
Situated on St. Clements Street, one of Oxford''s most desirable locations, residents enjoy immediate access to an array of independent cafés, restaurants, shops and excellent transport connections, while Oxford city centre, the universities and the beautiful walks of South Park are all within easy reach.', 'Taylors Estate Agents, Oxford City', '2026-07-10T10:30:37Z', '2026-10-24T10:54:52Z', '[]', 'train');
A particular feature is the installation of a Mechanical Ventilation with Heat Recovery (MVHR) system—a premium whole-house ventilation system. Installed as part of the renovation, this required the replacement of all ceilings and provides a continuous supply of filtered fresh air while recovering heat from extracted air, improving energy efficiency, air quality and year-round comfort.
The welcoming entrance hall features elegant Italian porcelain flooring, setting the tone for the high specification found throughout the property. The accommodation includes a spacious sitting room, conservatory overlooking the garden, a well-appointed kitchen with a range of integrated appliances including newly installed white goods and oven, separate utility room and a guest cloakroom.
On the first floor are four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a generous principal suite with fitted wardrobes, walk-in dressing area and ensuite shower room. A second bedroom also benefits from bespoke fitted wardrobes, while the beautifully refitted family bathroom has been finished to an excellent standard and benefits from underfloor heating.

Outside

To the rear the property enjoys a terraced private garden backing directly onto mature woodland, providing a peaceful and secluded setting with an attractive leafy outlook. The garden offers an ideal space for outdoor entertaining, family life and relaxation, with the woodland creating an exceptional sense of privacy. To the front a detached garage and driveway can be found offering ample parking.

Situation

