The well-equipped kitchen features an extensive range of fitted units, generous work surfaces, breakfast bar and integrated appliances, with space for a breakfast table overlooking the front of the property. An adjoining utility room offers additional storage and appliance space, together with direct access to the garage and rear garden.

To the first floor, the principal bedroom benefits from a dressing area with fitted wardrobes and a stylish ensuite shower room. Three further well-proportioned bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes, are served by a contemporary family bathroom, creating comfortable accommodation for growing families and visiting guests alike.

Outside

Looking outside the rear garden boasts a large patio, with spans the majority of the extent of the rear garden, alongside a well proportioned lawn, making an ideal space for relaxing or entertaining. Mature trees border the rear garden and add a sense of privacy. To the front the driveway provides parking for multiple vehicles, with the single garage providing further options for parking or storage.

Situation

The popular village of Seal lies within an AONB and offers local shops including a general store and butcher, along with a well-regarded primary school. A recreation ground is close by, together with a golf club, tennis and cricket clubs. Further amenities, including state and private primary, secondary and grammar schools, can be found in nearby Sevenoaks, approximately 0.9 miles away. Property Ref Number:
