This plot situated on Serpentine Road provides an exciting opportunity to buy a superbly located plot complete with build contract for a 4 bedroom detached house on the sought after Serpentine Road.

Planning permission ref: 26/00411/FUL ''Erection of two storey detached dwelling with off-street parking, landscaping and associated works.''

The proposed dwelling comprises an entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, four bedrooms with en-suite facilities, ground floor study/bedroom 5 with en suite shower room, utility room and cloakroom. Externally a driveway will provide off road parking, with landscaped gardens and a paved terrace to the rear of the property.

