Description

3 beautifully presented family homes offering a superb blend of space, light, and contemporary design, ideally positioned for access to highly regarded local schools.

The ground floor has been thoughtfully designed to provide an elegant open-plan layout, creating a light-filled and sociable living space ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. A refined palette of contemporary finishes, high-quality materials, and subtle lighting design combine to deliver a warm, inviting, and sophisticated atmosphere.

At the heart of the home lies a beautifully crafted bespoke kitchen, where style meets practicality. Premium stone worktops offer a sleek and durable surface, complemented by custom-designed cabinetry. A full suite of integrated appliances ensures the space is as functional as it is visually striking. Designer metal finishes add a contemporary edge, while carefully considered lighting, including recessed spotlights and under-cabinet LED illumination, enhances both ambience and usability.

The bathrooms are finished to an exceptional standard, offering a luxurious and tranquil retreat. Large-format Italian porcelain tiles extend seamlessly across walls and floors, enhancing the sense of space and cohesion. High-quality chrome fittings, bespoke vanity units, and indulgent rainfall showerheads complete the space, creating a calm, spa-inspired environment designed for comfort and relaxation.

Featherstone Homes’ provide a two-year builder’s warranty. Integrated kitchen appliances are also covered by full manufacturer warranties, offering long-term reliability and confidence in every detail.

Homes also benefit from a parking bay each with additional visitor bays available.

Location

Positioned to the north of Sevenoaks town centre, the properties enjoy a highly convenient setting, offering easy access to local schools and the mainline railway station.

Sevenoaks presents a vibrant lifestyle, centred around its bustling High Street, where well-known retailers sit alongside an array of independent boutiques, artisan cafés, and inviting restaurants. Charming courtyards and characterful hospitality venues add to the town’s distinctive appeal.

For a more extensive retail experience, Tunbridge Wells(approximately 14 miles) , while Bluewater and London’s West End are accessible via direct train connections.

The area is connected, with Sevenoaks providing rail services into Central London, as well as links across the South East and coastal destinations. Additional rail services are available from nearby stations including Dunton Green, Otford, Bat & Ball and Shoreham, offering further flexibility for commuters.

Renowned for its outstanding educational offering, Sevenoaks is one of Kent’s most sought-after locations for families. The area benefits from a wide selection of highly regarded state and independent schools, including grammar schools accessed via the Kent 11+ system, alongside prestigious preparatory and private institutions attracting students from across the globe.

Excellent road connectivity further enhances the location, with the A21, M25 and M20 all accessible, providing convenient routes to London and beyond. Major airports including Gatwick, Heathrow and London City are also within reach.

Leisure opportunities are abundant, catering to a wide range of interests. From cricket at the historic Vine and a variety of local sports clubs, to scenic countryside walks and cultural attractions, the area offers a superb balance of activity and relaxation. Sevenoaks Leisure Centre, local theatres, cinemas and nearby coastal resorts further enrich the lifestyle on offer, making this an exceptional place to live.

