Description

This superb first floor apartment was completely redeveloped and finished to a high standard by the current owner. Large windows throughout ensure all rooms are bathed in natural light. Features include bespoke joinery, beautiful wood flooring and air-conditioning.

The open plan reception/kitchen/dining area is a wonderful space for entertaining and relaxing.

There are two double bedrooms, both with fitted cupboards and en suite shower room, as well as a further guest cloakroom.

Location

Situated on the corner of the Kings Road and Edith Row, this brand new building is ideally placed for the boutiques, cafes and restaurants on the Kings Road. Fulham Broadway with its shopping centre, cinema and underground station is 0.3 miles from the property.

The number 22 bus runs along the Kings Road towards the West End (4 miles).

The green open space and tennis courts of Eel Brook Common are 0.2 miles away.

Please note that all distances are approximate.

Square Footage: 1,303 sq ft

Additional Info

