Located on the fifth floor, the apartment has been finished to the developer''s premium specification and features a beautifully appointed open-plan kitchen fitted with upgraded Miele appliances, including an integrated coffee machine, oven and wine cooler. The spacious reception and dining area is ideal for both entertaining and everyday living, with floor-to-ceiling glazing flooding the space with natural light and opening onto a private balcony overlooking the landscaped residents'' gardens.

The generous principal bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes and a stylish en-suite shower room, while the two further double bedrooms also enjoy direct access to the private balcony. A contemporary family bathroom completes the accommodation. Additional features include comfort cooling, engineered wooden flooring, ample built-in storage and a secure underground parking space.

