The location is equally impressive. Trafalgar Grove sits quietly on the cusp of East and West Greenwich, placing you within easy reach of the historic UNESCO-listed Maritime Greenwich, with its magnificent Royal Park, Royal Observatory, National Maritime Museum, Old Royal Naval College and iconic Cutty Sark. Greenwich town centre is also close by, with its superb selection of independent shops, cafés, restaurants and the bustling Greenwich Market.

