The kitchen is positioned at the heart of the home and is well complemented by a useful pantry and separate utility room with cloakroom facilities. A further reception room to the front offers superb flexibility and could serve as a family room, home office or ground floor bedroom if required.

On the first floor are four bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with en suite shower room. The remaining bedrooms are served by a family bathroom, making the layout perfectly suited to family life.

