Residents enjoy beautifully landscaped communal gardens, a concierge service, allocated underground parking, and the option to access the on-site gym, swimming pool and nursery facilities (available by separate membership), creating an exceptional lifestyle within the development. Highbury Stadium Square is renowned for its strong sense of community, while benefiting from excellent transport links, with Arsenal Underground Station (Piccadilly Line) just moments away and Drayton Park Overground providing quick and convenient access to the City. The property is offered chain free with the benefit of a long lease of over 900 years.

