The corner position offers the unusual benefits, particularly for a property of this age, of an off-road driveway with parking for two cars and a double-length garage accessible from both Maldon Road and the garden. The garage offers considerable potential for alternative uses, subject to any necessary consents, whether as additional living accommodation, a home office, studio or gym.

