One of the property''s strongest features is the rear garden. Mature trees and established planting create a private backdrop, while the generous plot offers plenty of space to enjoy now and potential to extend the house in the future, subject to the necessary planning consents. To the front, a driveway provides off-road parking and leads to the detached garage, with further mature planting softening the approach to the property.
Local Area
