Externally, the property enjoys an attractive frontage with a generous block paved driveway providing off-road parking for multiple vehicles and the prospect of vehicular access to the rear. The rear garden can also be accessed from the kitchen/diner, further enhancing the property''s appeal as a family home. Furthermore there is external storage cupboard housing a modern gas fired boiler, a patio beyond surrounded by a low wall plus an area of lawn and a timber shed.
Offering generous accommodation, flexible living space and a contemporary open-plan kitchen/dining area, this impressive home must be viewed to be fully appreciated.
