Upstairs there are two double bedrooms, both with wide windows and pleasant outlooks over neighbouring gardens and rooftops. The third bedroom is a single, well suited to a nursery, study or storage. The family bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with a bath, shower screen, vanity unit and WC.

Outside, the rear garden is a real feature, laid to a paved patio directly off the house with a lawn beyond and a garden shed. There is ample space for outdoor seating and for children to play, and the plot offers potential to extend subject to the usual consents.

Addiscombe is well served by tram links into East Croydon and central Croydon, with local shops, parks and schools close by.

