Situated on a popular residential road on the outskirts of Sevenoaks, this end of terrace property offers a versatile opportunity for both investors and owner-occupiers. Currently arranged as two self-contained flats, the property provides the flexibility of separate accommodation and could also offer the potential to convert back into a single family home, subject to the necessary planning permissions and consents.

