For investors, the existing configuration provides the opportunity to retain two separate dwellings and generate rental income, with the freehold ownership adding further appeal. Alternatively, those looking for a family home may wish to explore the potential of reconfiguring the property back into one larger residence, subject to the relevant permissions.

The location is particularly convenient for commuters, with Bat & Ball Station approximately 0.3 miles away and Sevenoaks Station around 1.3 miles away, providing access to London and surrounding areas. St Johns Hill is also nearby and offers a good selection of everyday amenities, including shops, cafés and local services, while Sevenoaks High Street is approximately 1.2 miles away and provides a wider range of shops, restaurants and leisure facilities.

With its freehold tenure, existing two-flat configuration, private rear garden and potential to create a substantial family home, this is a property offering a variety of possibilities depending on the purchaser''s requirements.

An internal viewing is highly recommended.

