A WORD FROM THE OWNER...

"We have been living on Colvestone Crescent for 20 years and love our home and the area. The whole flat was redesigned with architect Michael McNamara (LaMa Studio) to convert the loft space into a unique living and work space, with aerial views of the gardens and nearby St Mark church. Our other favourite part of the renovation is the mezzanine in the second double bedroom. Of course, it’s also a great street and area. There is a thriving community on Colvestone Crescent and everything Dalston has to offer on our doorstep. Yet, because it’s a no-through road, the flat is peaceful and quiet. This has been the perfect home for us to grow in. From our early days hosting dinner parties and film screenings, to our family home and the place where our two children are flourishing. So, whilst it’s time to move on, we will honestly miss it.”', 'The Stow Brothers, Hackney', '2026-10-02T10:19:37Z', '2026-10-23T22:52:58Z', '["floor_level"]', 'train');
