DESCRIPTION
Occupying an enviable elevated position in one of Rottingdean''s most sought-after residential locations, this substantial detached family home extends to approximately 2,600 sq ft and enjoys delightful sea views whilst offering exceptionally versatile and spacious accommodation throughout. The property combines contemporary family living with a superb layout designed for both everyday life and entertaining on a grand scale.

The heart of the home is undoubtedly the impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and family space. Beautifully appointed with an extensive range of solid wood shaker-style units, the kitchen flows seamlessly into a bright dining area with vaulted ceiling, skylights and 3 separate openings onto the rear garden. Beyond this space is an expansive lounge.

Adding further flexibility are two additional living spaces, including a stunning cinema/games room with vaulted ceiling and projector screen. A large utility room, downstairs cloakroom and integral access to the garage complete the ground floor accommodation.

To the first floor, the property boasts four generous double bedrooms. The master bedroom benefits from a stylish en-suite shower room and attractive sea views, whilst a second bedroom also enjoys en-suite facilities. The remaining bedrooms are served by a well-appointed family bathroom, The attic is large and could be converted (STNPC).

To the rear is a lawned garden bordered by a slate patio and a resin bonded lower patio.

