A Home Designed for Living & Entertaining
The ground floor welcomes you into an impressive reception room extending to approximately 22ft, where contemporary finishes create a stylish yet comfortable environment. A beautiful bay window brings natural light into the room, while statement lighting, modern flooring and a striking feature wall add a sophisticated touch. Whether enjoying cosy family evenings or entertaining friends, this is a space that feels both welcoming and impressive. Moving towards the rear, the generously sized kitchen and dining area extends to approximately 20ft, providing a wonderful setting for everything from busy weekday mornings to relaxed weekend gatherings. A family bathroom completes the ground-floor accommodation.
Five Bedrooms – Space to Grow, Work & Unwind
Across the first and second floors, the property offers five bedrooms, providing excellent flexibility for a growing family or those seeking additional space to work from home. The first floor comprises three bedrooms, including a generously proportioned principal bedroom, while the second floor provides two further rooms and a separate shower room. Whether you require dedicated children''s bedrooms, guest accommodation, a dressing room or a private home office, the layout offers the freedom to adapt as your lifestyle evolves.
