For those who enjoy spending time outdoors, Jack Cornwell Park and Brooks Farm are practically on the doorstep, with further green spaces including Abbotts Park, Leyton Manor Park and Leyton Jubilee Park within the surrounding area.
A Home with Character, Space & Possibilities
