The apartment also includes a second well-proportioned double bedroom, ideal for guests or as a home office, along with a contemporary family bathroom featuring high-quality fixtures and finishes.

Additionally, this apartment comes with the added benefit of an allocated off-street parking space, providing secure and convenient parking.

